<title>BELGIUM: W. Europe car sales up 9.0 pct yr/yr in June - ACEA.</title>
<headline>W. Europe car sales up 9.0 pct yr/yr in June - ACEA.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>New car registrations in western Europe soared nine percent to 1,135,600 units in June compared with the same month last year, the European Automobile Manufacturers' Association (ACEA) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>In the first six months of the year, car registrations rose a more modest 1.7 percent to 6,991,700 cars compared with the first half of 1996.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom +32 2 287 68 11</p>
